# /worktrees: the repository's worktrees, a reviewed plan for a new one, and a cd staged in the composer.
Output assets/readme/worktrees.gif
# demo-still: assets/readme/worktrees.png 4s
# demo-still: assets/readme/worktrees-plan.png 9.5s

Hide
Type "cd ~/Projects/demo && git worktree add -q -b docs/readme ../demo-docs-readme && clear && nmsh"
Enter
Sleep 5s
Show

Type "/worktrees"
Sleep 0.5s
Enter
Sleep 3s
Down
Sleep 1.2s
Type "n"
Sleep 0.6s
Type "fix/strip-width"
Sleep 0.8s
Enter
Sleep 3s
Escape
Sleep 1s
Enter
Sleep 2.5s
